+
+## Known board condition
+
+`task-board validate` continues to report the pre-existing `PARENT_STATUS_MISMATCH` for `STORY-260715-lkshfz` (`to-dev` versus child aggregate `development`) while this task is in development. This is recorded evidence, not a bypass of an unsupported viability row or dependency.
